In the afternoon, I work a lot.
I write code for our project.
We also have short meetings.
Then it is five o'clock.
I finish work on time today.
I turn my laptop off.
I pack the laptop into my backpack.
Then I stand up.
Jonas is still sitting at his desk.
I go over to him.
I say, "Goodbye, Jonas!"
"See you tomorrow, Maya," he answers.
I take my jacket.
I put the jacket on.
Outside it is already a little dark.
I leave the office.
I head off to the U-Bahn.
